FURB132 [*] Use `s.discard("x")` instead of check and `remove`
  --> FURB132.py:12:1
   |
11 |   # FURB132
12 | / if "x" in s:
13 | |     s.remove("x")
   | |_________________^
help: Replace with `s.discard("x")`
   |
12 - if "x" in s:
13 -     s.remove("x")
12 + s.discard("x")
   |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

